                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontsize='8'>Green</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>: Error Rate is 0.5% or lower - Performance is Good</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='8'>Orange</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>: Error Rate is between 0.5% and 1% - Caution, Needs Monitoring</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='8'>Red</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>: Error Rate is greater than 1% - High error rate, Immediate Attention Required.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Error rate % Difference:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontsize='8'>Green</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>: Error Rate Difference with previous week less than or equal to 0 - The Error rate has either reduced or remained same.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='8'>Red</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>: Error Rate Difference with previous week greater than 0 - The Error Rate has Increased- Needs Monitoring</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
